p Hi #{USERNAME},
if REASON_DECLINED
  p #{BENEFICIARY} declined the transfer of your account.
else if WINDOW_END
  p Nobody accepted the transfer of your account to #{BENEFICIARY} before #{WINDOW_END}.
else
  p Nobody accepted the transfer of your account to #{BENEFICIARY} in time.
p Your account stays as it is.
p If you gave a name or a date of birth to identify #{BENEFICIARY}, this information has been deleted.
if ACCOUNT_APP_URL
  p
    | To set up a new choice, sign in to your account page:
    |
    a(href=ACCOUNT_APP_URL target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{ACCOUNT_APP_URL}
else
  p To set up a new choice, sign in to your account page.
